wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 15K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:40<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Simples:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Com T-Shirt Oficial:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Opcional)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:50<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Simples:<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Com T-Shirt Oficial:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Opcional)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida da 34\u00aa Volta a Silgueiros 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 34\u00aa Volta a Silgueiros 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na sede da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Social, Desportiva, Cultural e Recreativa de Silgueiros (Rua Jos\u00e9 Rodrigues, Lages do Outeiro), Viseu.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios oficiais das partidas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa desportivo inicia-se \u00e0s 09h00 com a Competi\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem (escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o), seguindo-se a prova principal da Corrida 15K \u00e0s 09h40 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 09h50.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) para a Corrida de 15 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite de prova para a Corrida 15K \u00e9 de 02h00. Ap\u00f3s esse per\u00edodo, o tr\u00e2nsito autom\u00f3vel \u00e9 restabelecido pelas autoridades competentes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Corrida 15K tem o valor de 12,00 \u20ac (ou 17,00 \u20ac com t-shirt), a Caminhada 5K custa 7,00 \u20ac (ou 12,00 \u20ac com t-shirt) e a Competi\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem \u00e9 gratuita (op\u00e7\u00e3o de 5,00 \u20ac com t-shirt). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o d\u00e1 direito a dorsal com chip, medalha finisher, garrafa de Vinho do D\u00e3o, seguro e banhos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o secretariado e o levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na sede da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o em Silgueiros no s\u00e1bado, 10 de outubro, das 15h00 \u00e0s 18h00, e no pr\u00f3prio domingo da prova, 11 de outubro, entre as 08h30 e as 09h30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial waitastart.com. O regulamento oficial detalhado em PDF est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para consulta e download direto no guia do Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"34\u00aa Volta a Silgueiros 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Silgueiros, Viseu\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Silgueiros\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida da 34\u00aa Volta a Silgueiros 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 34\u00aa Volta a Silgueiros 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na sede da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Social, Desportiva, Cultural e Recreativa de Silgueiros (Rua Jos\u00e9 Rodrigues, Lages do Outeiro), Viseu.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios oficiais das partidas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa desportivo inicia-se \u00e0s 09h00 com a Competi\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem (escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o), seguindo-se a prova principal da Corrida 15K \u00e0s 09h40 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 09h50.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) para a Corrida de 15 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite de prova para a Corrida 15K \u00e9 de 02h00. Ap\u00f3s esse per\u00edodo, o tr\u00e2nsito autom\u00f3vel \u00e9 restabelecido pelas autoridades competentes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Corrida 15K tem o valor de 12,00 \u20ac (ou 17,00 \u20ac com t-shirt), a Caminhada 5K custa 7,00 \u20ac (ou 12,00 \u20ac com t-shirt) e a Competi\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem \u00e9 gratuita (op\u00e7\u00e3o de 5,00 \u20ac com t-shirt). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o d\u00e1 direito a dorsal com chip, medalha finisher, garrafa de Vinho do D\u00e3o, seguro e banhos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o secretariado e o levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona na sede da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o em Silgueiros no s\u00e1bado, 10 de outubro, das 15h00 \u00e0s 18h00, e no pr\u00f3prio domingo da prova, 11 de outubro, entre as 08h30 e as 09h30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial waitastart.com. O regulamento oficial detalhado em PDF est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para consulta e download direto no guia do Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68384,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,559,478,624],"event_type_2":[726,820,102],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-54380","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-silgueiros-viseu","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-de-15-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-viseu"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-volta-a-silgueiros-1.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/54380","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=54380"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/54380\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":68798,"href":"http